invalid type: string "## 2. The Three-Layer Filtering Framework\n\nTo mitigate input injection risks, a layered defense strategy is used:\n\n1. **Rule-Based Filtering**  \n   Detects explicit malicious patterns using regular expressions, keyword blacklists, or allow-lists.  \n   Example: blocking commands like “system override”, “delete all”, or “run shell”.", expected f64earch Directi